       <property name="html">
        <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Arial'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:8px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;4. Método de la Secante&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;4.1. ¿Para qué sirve?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método de la secante es un algoritmo numérico abierto utilizado para encontrar raíces reales de ecuaciones no lineales de la forma:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) = 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(16)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Surge como una alternativa directa al método de Newton-Raphson para aquellos casos en los que calcular la derivada analítica &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;′(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) resulta muy complejo o computacionalmente costoso, conservando una velocidad de convergencia muy rápida (superlineal).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;4.2. Fundamento Matemático&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;En lugar de utilizar la recta tangente, el método aproxima la derivada &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;′(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) mediante una diferencia finita regresiva usando dos puntos anteriores &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; y &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;′(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Helvetica'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;≈&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:3px; margin-right:3px;&quot; align=&quot;center&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot; vertical-align:middle; padding-left:4; padding-right:4; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) − &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;)        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot; vertical-align:middle; padding-left:4; padding-right:4; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; − &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(17)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Geométricamente, esto equivale a trazar una recta secante que pasa por los puntos (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;)) y (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;)). La intersección de esta recta con el eje &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; define la siguiente aproximación &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;+1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;. A diferencia de la falsa posición, aquí no se exige que la raíz quede encerrada entre los puntos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;4.3. Fórmulas Principales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1. Fórmula iterativa de recurrencia:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Sustituyendo la aproximación de la derivada en la fórmula de Newton-Raphson (partiendo de dos valores iniciales &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; y &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, y siempre que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) ≠ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;)):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
